{"jesus-christ/miracles-and-compassion.html":{"baseline_render_sha256":"124e8cb87da561459184bb8a70498df462dee04fb10625826592403db0c80f47","reviewed_render_sha256":"f01dbd8af90d3ebae5a54c1fa08fabda048156da0a58323f82599c3fd9b49d9d","script":"<script src=\"/six-scene-artwork.js?v=20261011-six-source-1\" defer></script>\n","section":"<section class=\"fc-deep-study\" id=\"christ-hospital-corridor\" data-connected-study>\n<h2>While you wait</h2>\n<figure class=\"fc-study-visual\" data-exclusive-artwork=\"christ-hospital-corridor\"><a href=\"/assets/page-art/christ-world/christ-hospital-corridor-full.webp\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"Explore artwork: While you wait\" data-full-image-alt=\"Christ and a woman holding an overnight bag stand apart in a quiet hospital corridor.\" data-topic-study=\"#next-study\" data-topic-study-label=\"Continue the surrounding study\"><img style=\"--study-image-ratio:1584/993;aspect-ratio:auto 1584/993\" src=\"/assets/page-art/christ-world/christ-hospital-corridor-960.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/page-art/christ-world/christ-hospital-corridor-480.webp 480w, /assets/page-art/christ-world/christ-hospital-corridor-960.webp 960w, /assets/page-art/christ-world/christ-hospital-corridor-full.webp 1584w\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) calc(100vw - 36px), 960px\" width=\"1584\" height=\"993\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Christ and a woman holding an overnight bag stand apart in a quiet hospital corridor.\"></a><figcaption><p class=\"fc-study-visual-label\">Explore and study</p><p>Christ listens while a woman waits with an overnight bag in a quiet hospital corridor.</p><p>An overnight bag hangs from a woman&#x27;s shoulder as she waits outside a hospital room. Christ stands nearby, leaving her space, and meets her eyes. Behind them, the corridor stretches into the night; the moment is quiet and unfinished.</p><p>Alma teaches that Christ knows the pains and sicknesses of His people. During a hospital wait, we may have little to say and much to feel. Sitting beside someone, bringing a meal or listening without rushing can offer real comfort. We do not need an answer to every question before we can be good company.</p><p>How could you support someone whose waiting has no clear end?</p><p class=\"fc-study-visual-sources\"><a class=\"fc-inline-scripture\" href=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/study/scriptures/bofm/alma/7?lang=eng&amp;id=p11-p13#p11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Alma 7:11-13</a></p></figcaption></figure>\n</section>\n","section_anchor":"<section class=\"jj-chapter\" id=\"next-study\">","style":"<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/six-scene-artwork.css?v=20261011-six-source-1\">\n"},"jesus-christ/parables/good-samaritan.html":{"baseline_render_sha256":"5bf1794022be1a46839563233806cccd2995ff59237857da94a33092d7cbceda","reviewed_render_sha256":"b7347d3972bf58a0a6afbd4e1cff448c3248eff4b53fe5ee55bbb856ff518ff0","script":"<script src=\"/six-scene-artwork.js?v=20261011-six-source-1\" defer></script>\n","section":"<section class=\"fc-deep-study\" id=\"christ-responder-rest\" data-connected-study>\n<h2>A moment to rest</h2>\n<figure class=\"fc-study-visual\" data-exclusive-artwork=\"christ-responder-rest\"><a href=\"/assets/page-art/christ-world/christ-responder-rest-full.webp\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"Explore artwork: A moment to rest\" data-full-image-alt=\"Christ listens to a firefighter resting beside a fire engine with her helmet nearby.\" data-topic-study=\"#living-the-invitation\" data-topic-study-label=\"Continue the surrounding study\"><img style=\"--study-image-ratio:1586/992;aspect-ratio:auto 1586/992\" src=\"/assets/page-art/christ-world/christ-responder-rest-960.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/page-art/christ-world/christ-responder-rest-480.webp 480w, /assets/page-art/christ-world/christ-responder-rest-960.webp 960w, /assets/page-art/christ-world/christ-responder-rest-full.webp 1586w\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) calc(100vw - 36px), 960px\" width=\"1586\" height=\"992\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Christ listens to a firefighter resting beside a fire engine with her helmet nearby.\"></a><figcaption><p class=\"fc-study-visual-label\">Explore and study</p><p>Those who help others also need care.</p><p>A firefighter sits beside the engine, her helmet set down beside her. Christ stands nearby and meets her eyes as daylight softens behind them. The scene gives attention to the person after the urgent work has paused.</p><p>The care Jesus describes in Matthew 25 belongs to the person who usually gives it, too. After demanding work, a meal, an unhurried conversation or time with family can be a welcome gift. We can appreciate someone&#x27;s service and help them find time to rest, laugh and enjoy an ordinary evening.</p><p>Who cares for others and could use your care today?</p><p class=\"fc-study-visual-sources\"><a class=\"fc-inline-scripture\" href=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/study/scriptures/nt/matt/25?lang=eng&amp;id=p35-p40#p35\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Matthew 25:35-40</a></p></figcaption></figure>\n</section>\n","section_anchor":"<section class=\"jj-chapter\" id=\"living-the-invitation\" data-chapter-group=\"receiving-the-word\">","style":"<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/six-scene-artwork.css?v=20261011-six-source-1\">\n"}}
